  "title": "Why You Shouldn’t Wait for Symptoms in Your Plants",
  "summary": "In addition to being better for the health of your plants and budget, plant health care supports the health of the environment, too. By keeping your landscape in top shape and staying abreast of soil health, you’ll need fewer chemical applications and harsh pest controls and only apply targeted amounts of fertilizer when tests indicate it’s needed.",
